    "rich_text_kHrpdi": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_iCWtXP": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Paper Tapes From NADCO",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_WhGitB": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At <strong>NADCO® Tapes & Labels</strong>, we specialize in supplying high-performance tapes and adhesive products for a wide range of industrial and commercial uses. One of our core product categories is paper and masking tapes. These tapes are available in multiple materials, strengths, adhesive types, and finishes to support specific requirements for removability, printability, temperature resistance, and overall performance.</p><p>Our paper and masking tape offerings include:</p><ul><li><strong>General-purpose masking tapes</strong></li><li><strong>Moisture-resistant masking tapes</strong></li><li><strong>Printable rope paper tapes</strong></li><li><strong>Paper identification tapes</strong></li></ul><p>In addition to standard options, NADCO® can customize paper tape solutions to meet unique application needs, including specialty widths, die-cutting, color coding, or printed identification.</p><p>For more information about our paper tape offerings—or for help selecting the best option for your application—please <a href=\"/collections/all\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"All products\"><strong>browse our catalog</strong></a> or <a href=\"/pages/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Contact us\"><strong>contact us</strong></a> today.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        }
      },
